{"text": "Fsea17-6 TATRT,\n\u2018SUBJECT: CAMEL Spoting\n\nSALES REP\n\nom\nor Rw\nRETAIL REP\n\nBeginning in August, CAMEL will aunch a new advertising campaign designed to be more relevant for our\nadult smokers. The new campaign wil feature What You're Looking For\" through all magazine and\nbillboard advertising. Print will accentuate the sophistication of the new campaign by involving adult\n\u2018smokers in an interesting and sublie manner via the trademarked CAMEL. Billboards will feature the\ntrademarked CAMEL as an immediately recognizable icon that ties into CAMEL brand positioning. The\ntrademarked CAMEL will be featured as a consistent component throughout all elements of the brands\nadvertising plans. (Retail wil maintain the purple and yellow trademark look.)\n\nTo build awareness of the new advertising theme and tie the new ad campaign to retail an impactful retail\npromotion has been developed.\n\nThe promotion \u201cCAMEL Spotting!\u201d is designed to keep CAMEL a priority while attempting to minimize\nField Sales involvement. Itis a presence program ulizing high impact POS pieces sold by RJR sales\nforce and placed by retailers. These POS pieces would indicate to consumers that account is participating\nin the program. Twenty-four milion promotional announcements, featuring a detachable CAMEL coupon,\nwill be distributed via direct mail and magazine inserts. Consumers will be instructed to take the CAMEL\n\u2018coupon to a participating retailer and place it under a special red fiter on the POS to reveal if they won\ncone of three major prizes or @ free pack of CAMEL. \"CAMEL Spotting\u201d consists ofthe following\nelements:\n\nProgram Overview\n+ Timing: 1001197 -11/15197.\n\n+ Available to RUR contract partner accounts only.\n+ Sweepstakes type promotion where virtually everyone is @ winner (70% of players win).\n+ Designed to drive consumers to retail to discover what they have won.\n\n\u2018+ AIIRUR retail partner accounts can participate; however, our emphasis should be on package outlets,\nexcluding drug stores.\n\n\u2018+ Program not to be worked in Michigan, Minnesota, Utah, Virginia, Massachusetts due to legal\nrestrictions.\n\nProgram Details\n\n\u2018\u00a9 24:milion promotional announcements wil be distributed via direct mail & media (magazines)\nbeginning in iate September.\n\n\u2018+The promotional announcement will feature a detachable CAMEL coupon. Consumers will be\ninstructed to take the CAMEL coupon to retail and find out ifthey won one of three major prizes or @\nfree pack of CAMELs.\n\n\u2018\u00a9 Atretail consumers place their CAMEL coupon behind a special red fiter on the POS display to reveal\nif they won a prize.\n\n4699 \u00a308TS",
